WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:16.889
Izzie was jumping around the gym.

2
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.976
She was pretending to be her pet frog, Gurpy.

3
00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:24.662
"Gurp. Gurp," she called.

4
00:00:24.663 --> 00:00:27.478
It was the second-to-last day of school.

5
00:00:27.479 --> 00:00:36.127
That meant it was also the second-to-last day of Kids Central.

6
00:00:36.128 --> 00:00:43.740
"Attention, frogs and race-car drivers," Miss Shelly called.

7
00:00:43.741 --> 00:00:52.513
"We are ready to make today's craft—tissue-paper flowers."

8
00:00:52.514 --> 00:00:55.624
Bobby pulled a dirty tissue out of his pocket.

9
00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:58.309
"I've got a tissue right here!

10
00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:04.279
I just blew my nose on it."

11
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.618
"Not that kind of tissue, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:01:08.619 --> 00:01:12.287
"We're going to use clean wrapping tissue."

13
00:01:12.288 --> 00:01:16.149
She pointed to the colored tissue paper on the table.

14
00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:19.977
"Gurp. I mean, great," Izzie said.

15
00:01:19.978 --> 00:01:25.066
Nina giggled.

16
00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.267
"You kids are too silly today,"

17
00:01:27.268 --> 00:01:30.278
Miss Shelly said, shaking her head.

18
00:01:30.279 --> 00:01:33.405
"Okay, let's make our flowers.

19
00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:38.586
First fold one end of your tissue paper about three centimeters.

20
00:01:38.587 --> 00:01:41.110
Then flip the tissue over.

21
00:01:41.111 --> 00:01:47.661
Next take the same edge you folded before, and fold it three centimeters the other way.

22
00:01:47.662 --> 00:01:51.024
Then flip it back over and fold again.

23
00:01:51.025 --> 00:01:56.791
Keep repeating this until you have folded the entire tissue.

24
00:01:56.792 --> 00:02:04.450
Now wrap one end of your pipe cleaner around the middle of your folded tissue," Miss Shelly said.

25
00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:13.569
"Then carefully pull apart the folds and . . . you’ve got a pretty flower!"

26
00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.634
"This is easy," Izzie said.

27
00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:19.755
She was making a green flower.

28
00:02:19.756 --> 00:02:22.312
"I'm going to make another one!"

29
00:02:22.313 --> 00:02:28.136
Izzie reached for another piece of tissue paper.

30
00:02:28.137 --> 00:02:34.477
"Attack!" Bobby yelled as he jabbed Jason with his paper flower.

31
00:02:34.478 --> 00:02:39.751
"Hey!" Jason grabbed his flower and poked Bobby back.

32
00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:46.136
"Boys, these are flowers, not swords," Miss Shelly said sharply.

33
00:02:46.137 --> 00:02:48.586
"Miss Shelly, can you help me?

34
00:02:48.587 --> 00:02:52.544
I can't pull my tissue apart," Nina said.

35
00:02:52.545 --> 00:02:57.575
While Miss Shelly helped Nina, Izzie made three more green flowers.

36
00:02:57.576 --> 00:03:02.539
When she finished, she tied all of the ends of the pipe cleaners together.

37
00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:10.126
Then she made four more flowers and tied those ends together too.

38
00:03:10.127 --> 00:03:13.001
"Look!" Izzie called out.

39
00:03:13.002 --> 00:03:15.726
"I'm a frog princess."

40
00:03:15.727 --> 00:03:21.338
She was wearing a crown of green flowers.

41
00:03:21.339 --> 00:03:24.164
"And you're my frog prince!"

42
00:03:24.165 --> 00:03:31.157
She dropped another crown over Jason's head. "Gurp!"

43
00:03:31.158 --> 00:03:35.271
Jason chased Izzie around the gym.

44
00:03:35.272 --> 00:03:39.120
"I'm not your frog prince!" he yelled.

45
00:03:39.121 --> 00:03:47.530
"Ooh, Izzie and Jason, sitting in a tree," Bobby began to chant.

46
00:03:47.531 --> 00:03:49.377
Miss Shelly stood up.

47
00:03:49.378 --> 00:03:54.678
"Izzie, Jason, Bobby. What is going on?"

48
00:03:54.679 --> 00:03:57.222
Izzie and Jason stopped running.

49
00:03:57.223 --> 00:03:59.427
Bobby stopped chanting.

50
00:03:59.428 --> 00:04:02.057
They stared at Miss Shelly.

51
00:04:02.058 --> 00:04:05.683
"We were going to go outside for our treat today.

52
00:04:05.684 --> 00:04:09.710
But I don't know if you three deserve it," their teacher said.

53
00:04:09.711 --> 00:04:11.497
She was serious.

54
00:04:11.498 --> 00:04:15.191
"I was thinking about Gurpy," Izzie said.

55
00:04:15.192 --> 00:04:20.782
"And I thought, what if Gurpy became a frog prince and I became a princess?

56
00:04:20.783 --> 00:04:25.348
So I made Jason be a frog prince. Sorry."

57
00:04:25.349 --> 00:04:27.069
Miss Shelly sighed.

58
00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:34.288
"Okay. Let's clean up and go outside."

59
00:04:34.289 --> 00:04:39.705
When it was time to go, Izzie tapped Miss Shelly on the arm.

60
00:04:39.706 --> 00:04:44.578
"Here." She handed Miss Shelly a bunch of tissue flowers.

61
00:04:44.579 --> 00:04:49.874
"We decided that you deserve the treat today."

62
00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:52.372
"Gurp!" said Miss Shelly.

63
00:04:52.373 --> 00:05:02.158
"I mean, thank you, Frog Princess!"
